From: Gleb Radchenko <14540409+GlebRadchenko@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:15:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] ggml: GGML_OP_LOOP_GATE (gated loop update, optional
 fused RMS norm); Inkling2 loop controllers use the elementwise form

tanh, 2 muls, sub and add in one fully parallel dispatch. The norm-fused form (INK_GATE_NORM=1) runs one threadgroup
per row and measured 1.5% slower, so it is off. A/B tg64 36.0 -> 37.0 tok/s. KLD vs CPU 0.00129 (ub 512), 0.00117 (ub 1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
